    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d250">

                <pb facs="0520" n="500" xml:id="pg500"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Lord Lyons.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-01-22"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 22, 1864.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Lord</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your note of the 15th instant, transmitting a copy of a despatch and
                    of its enclosures, received by you from the governor general of Canada, relative
                    to the detention of live stock by the United States customs authorities at
                    Niagara suspension bridge.</p>
                <p>In reply, I have the honor to enclose herewith the copy of a letter of the 19th
                    instant, addressed to this department by the Secretary of the Treasury, to whom
                    the matter was referred, and to be, with high consideration, your lordship’s
                    obedient servant.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Right Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lord Lyons</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d250-a1.xml" xpointer="d250-a1"/>
            </div>
